     1	# `swegemma` Evaluation Harness & Competitor Guide
     2	
     3	This document provides a complete technical reference for the **`swegemma`** evaluation harness and its companion libraries (**`adk-submission`** and **`adk-eval-core`**). It explains how competitor submissions are validated and compiled, how the harness orchestrates agent sessions and sandboxes, how the built-in tools behave, and how generated patches are extracted and graded.
     4	
     5	---
     6	
     7	## Table of Contents
     8	
     9	1. [System Architecture & Library Stack](#1-system-architecture--library-stack)
    10	2. [Submission Contract & Declarative Agent Schema (`adk-submission`)](#2-submission-contract--declarative-agent-schema-adk-submission)
    11	3. [Model Registry, Single-Model Rule & LoRA Adapters on 4x L4 GPUs](#3-model-registry-single-model-rule--lora-adapters-on-4x-l4-gpus)
    12	4. [Two-Phase Evaluation Lifecycle](#4-two-phase-evaluation-lifecycle)
    13	5. [Harness-to-Agent Interaction Protocol](#5-harness-to-agent-interaction-protocol)
    14	6. [Built-In Tools Reference (`swegemma.tools`)](#6-built-in-tools-reference-swegemmatools)
    15	7. [Budgets, Operational Limits & Context Management](#7-budgets-operational-limits--context-management)
    16	8. [Patch Extraction & Phase 2 Verification (`verify_task`)](#8-patch-extraction--phase-2-verification-verify_task)
    17	9. [Local CLI Usage & Output Artifacts](#9-local-cli-usage--output-artifacts)
    18	10. [Competitor Best Practices & Important Gotchas](#10-competitor-best-practices--important-gotchas)
